    {
      "id": "claim_2433395fad1a45f9bbc7fc1b065daaff",
      "statement": "The host/client boundary in dsh-pet-panel is an explicit RPC contract, not shared imports. The host side (src/index.ts) exposes three TypertRemoteService gateways (SkillForgeGateway, ToolIntegrationsGateway, A2AConfigGateway) whose public methods are annotated with @Remote('<method>'); the client side (src/client/remote.ts) carries a hand-written TYPERT_REMOTE manifest mounted onto the Typert client remote via ctx.remote.$mount(TYPERT_REMOTE). Host methods are discovered at runtime by the api-gateway from the typertRemote binding plus the @Remote marker table in source mode, so no generated /typert artifact is required.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/index.ts#L181-L183",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d385127eb4bf01d2b764d5ca7c890ab836a9d2bf1777c9f82d650b19f7d58e9:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/remote.ts#L138-L159",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3330ff314c57fa6133ad34e8f96cec8277acda3fdd5f8eff037a0f729df999b0:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/index.ts#L159-L169",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:41d3435f705e94cb3cb840de1117351f591f3a8052e30603a1f33cf84a9e8d15:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7ed9040c55a64d92b2d10f27c2f4892b",
      "statement": "Every Typert remote call resolves to the discriminated envelope { ok: true, value: T } | { ok: false, error: { code, message, details } }. The client unwrap() helper collapses it by throwing new Error(r.error?.message ?? 'remote call failed') when r.ok is false, and returning r.value otherwise. Capability views build their api objects by wrapping each ctx.remote.<ns> call in unwrap(), so a host failure surfaces as a Promise rejection the view renders inline.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/index.ts#L100-L118",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fac35ab2c1bafa7b833fda9d1baf92e3435b64d66485a00c45fe1c87ff1a0d80:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/index.ts#L36-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6ee71680a1f95cb4e2606bd055165e5a54e72f60dc89cd90e00763951c5e9f55:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_60c80f04dc2640139f391400bf7e2028",
      "statement": "The Typert boundary rejects non-JSON-safe values via assertJsonValue, including a plain object that has an own property with value undefined. zod .optional() parsing leaves such undefined-valued own properties in place, so a host method that returns an absent optional field (pervasive in the lifecycle event folding, where turn/step/text/toolName/isError/outcome/reason/todos are conditionally undefined) would fail boundary validation. compact() strips undefined-valued properties from results before returning; it is applied per event and again to the final lifecycle snapshot in src/index.ts#L340-L408.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/index.ts#L147-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0023c13ab37f30054a689f81e263520c4adb3b0e82d14c333151be7ad7e2c832:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/index.ts#L340-L408",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b2b66f1180a10041874c239633a6192e6595eaaa33b3c57fc67b67ed2239ab6c:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e99fb05b388a4dafa1a051b18cd1adbe",
      "statement": "The client TYPERT_REMOTE descriptor and the host @Remote method are kept in sync by hand: each descriptor uses jsonParam to describe ordered position parameters (source 'json') and strictResult to describe the business return value, with ids of the form dsh-pet-panel#<namespace>/<method> and invocation { kind: 'direct' }. The full surface spans skillForge (list/read/write/delete/generate/lifecycle), toolIntegrations (list/read/write/delete), and a2aConfig (get/setCard/upsertAgent/delete). A mismatch between the @Remote signature and the manifest produces an ambiguous endpoint or a 'business result failed boundary validation' from the strict result codec.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/client/remote.ts#L100-L159",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cb649f65e0149477c40471bf95f44d52f1e097d6a452eb23e1707fdd16f2cd4d:"
