    {
      "id": "claim_84b3d97f693049a78cd3099d40d08341",
      "statement": "The main client apply(ctx) context injects only ['slots', 'locale', 'remote']; the remote.<ns> namespace sub-services are mounted by $mount. Therefore the capability views (SkillForgeView, ToolIntegrationsView, A2AView) and the TaskManagerView lifecycle wrapper are registered inside a child plugin 'pet-panel-capabilities' whose inject list is ['slots', 'locale', 'remote', 'remote.skillForge', 'remote.toolIntegrations', 'remote.a2aConfig']. Touching remote.skillForge in the main apply(ctx) body throws 'without inject', because that context only holds remote. $mount returns a TypertDisposer registered via ctx.effect, so plugin unload withdraws the exact contribution.",
      "evidence": [
